---
source: cli/src/remote_options_tests.rs
expression: help
---
Usage: codex [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --remote <ADDR>
          Connect the TUI to a remote app server endpoint.

          Accepted forms: `ws://host[:port][/path]`, `wss://host[:port][/path]`,
          `unix://`, or `unix://PATH`. WebSocket ports default to 80 for ws and
          443 for wss.

      --remote-auth-token-env <ENV_VAR>
          Name of the environment variable containing the bearer token to send
          to a remote app server websocket

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
